    "abstract": "Parts figure for the flight data recorder installation, showing the recorder position, the mounting tray in its delivered and isolated standards and the harness retention hardware.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure shows the flight data recorder installation on the aft avionics rack, with the mounting tray, the isolators and the harness retention hardware.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the rack looking aft with the recorder in position. Item 10 is the recorder assembly. Items 30 and 30A are the harness retention standards: the cushioned loop clamp at item 30 is used with the isolated tray and must not be replaced by the earlier clamp at item 30A, which is stiffer and defeats the isolation. Isolator quantity at item 20 is four per tray and they are supplied as a matched set."
    },
